                    frame_technical:        `A technical project — get the integration live and stable; the people side follows the system`,
                    frame_cost:             `A cost programme — the ZAR 95M is the point; surveillance worries are noise we manage with comms`,
                    risk_rejection:         `The social subsystem rejecting the technical one — gaming, work-to-rule and a union dispute that turns the ZAR 95M gain into a loss`,
                    risk_bugs:              `Technical bugs — the integration breaking at go-live is the only thing that can really hurt us`,
                    risk_press:             `Only the journalist — one bad week of “surveillance” headlines we can ride out`,
                    risk_contained:         `Nothing systemic — adoption, the union and POPIA are separate issues, each survivable alone`,

