                    r4_defence_label:       `Your defence to the board-and-union forum.`,
                    r4_conviction_label:    `Conviction: how firmly do you hold that responsible governance, not avoidance, is the goal? (%)`,
                    safe_oversight:         `An independent ethics/oversight review of the algorithm, with worker representation in system governance`,
                    safe_hitl:              `Human-in-the-loop review of any individual decision, plus an employee data-rights & appeal mechanism`,
                    safe_charter:           `An algorithmic-use charter published on the intranet — a clear statement of our values`,
